.TH INODUNE\-DESKTOP 1 "2026-11-02" "inodune 0.1.11" "User Commands"
.SH NAME
inodune\-desktop \- Inodune desktop app: review and clean local caches
.SH SYNOPSIS
.B inodune\-desktop

.SH DESCRIPTION
Opens the Inodune desktop application. It analyzes local caches read-only,
explains each item, keeps credentials, sessions, Git and Terraform state
protected, and only cleans after explicit confirmation. Files go to the Trash
by default. No account, telemetry or administrative permission is used.
.SH SEE ALSO
https://github.com/caiolombello/inodune
